<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans fell in Jan 29 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans fell in Jan 29 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED JANUARY 22</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............792,500 up.....2,100</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......702,100 up.....5,700</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......514,600 down...3,100</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED JANUARY 29</p>
<p>U.S. commercial paper.....808,955 up.....3,062</p>
<p> Financial companies.......622,514 up.....4,462</p>
<p> New York business loans....43,498 down......48</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......43,266 down......53</p>
</text>
